/-!
# Certificates for the 64 elementary Schreier eliminations

Each certificate specifies an original defining relation, earlier eliminations
that can be substituted in it, and an inverse/conjugation giving the desired
relation after free cancellation. The final certificates use the same rules for
the 51 compact relations. Short expansion words also record generation.

Generated by `source/generate_replay.py` from `source/schreier.json`.
The generator is untrusted; `CompactRelations` checks every word equality and
proves the acyclic replay sound in the literal raw presentation.
Source: ATLAS `S62G1-P1.M`, M2; see `source/README.md`.
-/

@[expose] public section
